Z||000000||RedHaze86SD4||11-13-2001||08:13 AM||||There is a guy running a '87 Fastback GT on a friends oval track down here. He's got the 3.3L and manual transaxle out of an '85 Porsche 911 Turbo. He's been running top speeds of 165 on the tracks clock. I haven't been able to talk to him yet, but I've gotten an up close look at the car, and other than removing a portion of the rear storage area and relocating the battery to the front, it looks like it could have come that way. I don't think I'd ever go with that choice but thought someone might like the idea.<P>------------------<BR>The Possabilities are only hindered by your imagination and will to make them come alive....<P>-=Red Haze.. Its coming=-||||reg||5
